{"ref":"BDB, נָמֵר","hw":"נָמֵר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">נָמֵר</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup>Is 11:6</sup> <strong>leopard</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 13:7\" href=\"/Hosea.13.7\">Ho 13:7</a> + 3 times; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">נְמֵרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:8\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.8\">Hb 1:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:8\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.8\">Ct 4:8</a>;—<em>leopard</em>, as spotted <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 13:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.13.23\">Je 13:23</a>, swift <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:8\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.8\">Hb 1:8</a>, keen-eyed <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:6\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.6\">Je 5:6</a> (symb. of calamities of Isr.), so <a data-ref=\"Hosea 13:7\" href=\"/Hosea.13.7\">Ho 13:7</a> (sim. of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">נ׳ עִם־גְּדִי יִרְבָּ֑ץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 11:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.11.6\">Is 11:6</a> (predict.); <span dir=\"rtl\">הַרֲרֵי נְמֵרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 4:8\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.4.8\">Ct 4:8</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">מְעֹנוֹת אֲרָיוֹת</span>).","next":"BDB, נִמְרָה","prev":"BDB, נמר"}